{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>ויפקד</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: ויפקד המלך פקידים. Ahasuerus appointed officers to gather women for himself, therefore he was impoverished, as the Sages expounded: וישם המלך אחשרש מס — he became poor. And that is what is written: אל תתן לנשים חילך. But Joseph appointed officers to gather grain, therefore he grew wealthy, and he gathered all the silver."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:10.072386561Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}